        "description": "Twarabiye hamwe ivy' ukwiyubara abigira abavugishwa n'Imana, abo bamyeho kuva mu gihe c'isezerano rya kera nk'uko tubisoma mu cete ca 2 Petero 2 : 1. Petero rero arabwira abakristo b' Abayuda ati no muri mwebwe hazobaho abigisha b'ibinyoma. Turavye ingene ishengero rimeze uyu musi dusanga abigisha b'ibinyoma baragwiriye, babonekera mu nyigisho zirimwo amajambo yo kworohereza abantu atakudoma urutoke ku caha. Bavuga ibitarivyo ibigirankana kandi bazi ukuri ukwarikwo. Ivyo babigira kugira bironderere inyungu zabo ubwabo kandi ikibaranga n'ingeso z'isoni nke kuko ntibokwama imbuto za Mpwemu Yera batamufise ( 2 Petero 2 : 3 ).",
