        "description": "Twihwereje hamwe ibidushoboza gukora vyo Imana igomba no kuba abakristo b'ukuri. Twabonye ko ivyo vyose tubishobozwa n'ububasha bw'Imana. Kandi nk'uko twabisomye mu cete ca kabiri ca Petero 1:3 Ukumenya Yesu Kristo neza niko kudufasha kubabo twubaha Imana dukora nivyo igomba. Kwakira agakiza mukwizera Umwami Yesu biduha gusangira n'Imana akameremere kayo kandi bituma amasezerano y'Imana y'akaburarugero aba ayacu. (nk'uko twabisomye muri 2 Petero 1:4). Ivyasezeranywe vy'akaburarugero nivyinshi turavye mw'isezerano risha dusangamwo amajambo meza menshi aturemesha kandi atwereka ko Imana yadutonesheje cane, twacitse abana bayo kubw'ubuntu bwayo gusa. N'igitangaza rero kubona duhabwa n'Imana gusangira akameremere kayo. Kwizera Umwami Yesu,tugacika abana b'Imana biduha kuragwa ubugingo budashira ( 1 Yohana 5 : 12).",
