        "description": "Twumvise ingene ukwizera Umwami Yesu ari ikintu gihambaye c'akaburarugero kuko ariyo nzira yogushika mu bwami bw'ijuru. Twarabonye yuko uwizera ategerezwa kugira ingeso nziza n'ibindi vyamwa vya Mpwemu year . Petero mu cete ciwe ca kabiri yanditse: 2 Petero 1 : 13 yaravuze ko yari afise umwete wo kwibutsa abizera Imana ko bakwiye gushikama mu kwizera kwabo aravuga ati ndiyumvira yuko nkwiye kubakangura mbibutsa nkiri muri uru rusago. Twokwibukanya ko urusago yavuga wari uyu mubiri.Yari yiteguye kuvugira Imana akiriho yarazi ko asigaje igihe gito akicwa nkuko abivuga muri 2 Petero :1-14. Umwami Yesu yari yaramaze kumumenyesha ko igihe ciwe c'ugupfa kiri hafi. Petero rero yagira ati reka nkore ibikorwa vy'Imana ngifise umwanya naho ari muto.",
